        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "This is where I stayed during my recent Montreal trip. The place and the host are both amazing. The house is right next to the river. During day and night a cool breeze come towards you and it’s relaxing during a warm weather. The house is little away from the main road to give you a nice environment for meditation and relaxing. The host has a nice garden and made every effort to make our trip memorable. He helped us and taught my kid fishing at the private deck. During night you can see fishing coming on the surface and playing around. The view is amazing during the day and mesmerizing during the night. I already miss my stay there.",
